            <p class="note">Arriving from Lembongan — pools, sunset bar and dinner all at one magical property.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>~2:00 PM</strong> — Arrive villa, quick freshen up, drop bags</li>
                <li><strong>2:30 PM</strong> — 🚗 <strong>Grab or Gojek</strong> to Bambu Indah (~15 min) — book a few minutes before you're ready to leave</li>
                <li><strong>3:00–5:30 PM</strong> — 🌿 <strong>Bambu Indah Day Pass</strong><br>
                    Spring-fed natural pools, hidden Crystal Pool, mud bath, ice bath and wood-fired sauna. IDR 500,000 F&B credit per person at River Warung.<br>
                    From IDR 700,000/person + 21% tax | bambuindah.com or Klook — book ahead!</li>
                <li><strong>5:30 PM</strong> — 🛗 <strong>Elevator Sunset Bar — BOOKED ✅</strong><br>
                    World's only bamboo elevator up to clifftop bar. Organic cocktails, Sayan Valley rice field views at golden hour.<br>
                    Reservation: 5:30 PM | Jl. Baung, Sayan, Ubud</li>
                <li><strong>7:00 PM</strong> — 🍽️ <strong>Tembaga Restaurant — BOOKED ✅</strong><br>
                    Bambu Indah's on-site signature restaurant — walk straight from Elevator Bar. Open-air barn of bamboo, copper and stone. Live-fire grill, anti-inflammatory menu.<br>
                    Dinner reservation: 7:00 PM | WhatsApp: +62 811-5320-0100</li>
                <li><strong>9:00 PM</strong> — 🚗 Grab or Gojek back to villa — early night, adventure day tomorrow!</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="tip"><strong>💡 Note:</strong> Entire evening flows seamlessly at one property — pools → elevator bar → dinner. Grab/Gojek for transport to and from Bambu Indah.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <strong>📅 June 24 — Compact Adventure Day (Full Day with Villa Driver)</strong>
            <p class="note">Kumulilir Coffee → Manuaba Waterfall → Tegallalang Rice Terraces → Pura Mengening → OMMA. Everything in the Tegallalang corridor — under 1.5 hours total driving.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>9:00 AM</strong> — Depart villa with villa driver</li>
                <li><strong>9:20 AM</strong> — ☕ <strong>Kumulilir Coffee Plantation</strong><br>
                    Under-the-radar Luwak coffee plantation 9km north of Ubud. Guided coffee tour, tasting flight, jungle swing and views.<br>
                    Free entry | Luwak coffee ~50K IDR | Book ahead: kumulilir.id | ~45 min</li>
                <li><strong>10:15 AM</strong> — Drive to Manuaba Waterfall (~10 min)</li>
                <li><strong>10:30 AM</strong> — 💦 <strong>Manuaba Waterfall</strong><br>
                    Hidden "2-in-1" waterfall — two falls connected by a 30-min hike through rice fields and jungle. Swim at the second fall.<br>
                    Entry: ~20K IDR | Water shoes essential | ~75 min</li>
                <li><strong>12:00 PM</strong> — Drive to Tegallalang (~10 min)</li>
                <li><strong>12:15 PM</strong> — 🌾 <strong>Tegallalang Rice Terraces</strong><br>
                    Iconic terraces — walk the paddies, swing photos, soak it all in.<br>
                    Entry: ~25K IDR | ~60 min</li>
                <li><strong>1:30 PM</strong> — 🍽️ Lunch at a warung on the Tegallalang terraces | ~$5-8 USD | ~45 min</li>
                <li><strong>2:30 PM</strong> — Drive to Pura Mengening (~20 min)</li>
                <li><strong>3:00 PM</strong> — 🛕 <strong>Pura Mengening</strong><br>
                    Ancient 10th-century sacred spring temple — original source of Bali's holy water. Virtually no tourists. Afternoon golden light and local evening prayers make this truly intimate.<br>
                    Sarong required | Driver can stop for offerings (~20K IDR) | Entry: ~20K IDR | ~60 min</li>
                <li><strong>4:15 PM</strong> — Drive to OMMA (~20 min)</li>
                <li><strong>4:30 PM</strong> — 🎶 <strong>OMMA Dayclub — ⚠️ BOOK DAYBED</strong><br>
                    Golden hour through sunset — pool, music, cocktails. Stay until 7:00–7:30 PM.<br>
                    Book standalone Daybed at tablecheck.com/en/ommabali/reserve | IDR 3M minimum (IDR 2.7M returned as F&B credit) | ommabali.com</li>
                <li><strong>7:30 PM</strong> — 🍽️ Dinner at <strong>OMMA Dayclub restaurant</strong><br>
                    Stay on for dinner — Balinese Grilled Chicken Betutu, Babi Guling, Satay Lilit, Nasi Campur and an Indonesian cultural set meal featuring dishes from across the archipelago. F&B credit covers dinner so no extra cost!<br>
                    Last order at 8:00 PM | Closes 9:00 PM</li>
                <li><strong>9:00 PM</strong> — 🚗 Gojek or Grab back to villa (~20 min)</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="tip"><strong>💡 Pack:</strong> Sarong (Pura Mengening), water shoes (Manuaba), dry bag, swimwear under clothes for OMMA.</div>
        </div>

