            <strong>📅 June 26 — Slow Morning, Checkout & Transfer to Nusa Dua (Caitlyn, Al & Brie)</strong>
            <p class="note">Relaxed final Ubud morning — Sacred Monkey Forest, Sukawati Art Market, then on to the wedding.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>8:00 AM</strong> — Leisurely villa breakfast, no rush</li>
                <li><strong>9:00 AM</strong> — Villa pool or quiet coffee on terrace</li>
                <li><strong>10:30 AM</strong> — Checkout (by 11 AM)</li>
