                <li><strong>12:00 PM</strong> — 🏺 <strong>Sukawati Art Market</strong><br>
                    Authentic batik, sarongs, wood carvings and silver at real local prices — far cheaper than Ubud Art Market.<br>
                    Sukawati, Gianyar | Free entry | ~30 min | Bring cash — bargain at 40-50% of asking price</li>
