        <div class="card">
            <strong>🚇 Octopus Card — Get This First!</strong>
            <p>Pick up at Tung Chung MTR station — works on all MTR trains, buses, ferries, trams, plus convenience stores. Tap-and-go, no need for cash or individual tickets. Refundable deposit when you return it.</p>
            <p><strong>Tung Chung → Central (Hong Kong Island):</strong> MTR Tung Chung Line | ~30 min | ~HK$20</p>
            <p><strong>Star Ferry (Central → Tsim Sha Tsui):</strong> ~8 min | ~HK$3 | One of the most iconic rides in Asia</p>
            <p><strong>Tai O Alternative:</strong> Bus 11 from Tung Chung | ~30 min | Stays on Lantau Island — easy and relaxed</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="subsection">
