        <h4>Option B — Tai O Fishing Village (Stay Local on Lantau)</h4>
        <div class="card">
            <p class="note">If you'd rather keep it easy without the MTR — one of Hong Kong's most authentic and charming experiences, right on your island.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>9:00 AM</strong> — Checkout hotel, take Bus 11 from Tung Chung to Tai O (~30 min)</li>
                <li><strong>9:30 AM</strong> — 🏘️ <strong>Tai O Fishing Village</strong> — ancient stilt house fishing village, one of Hong Kong's most authentic spots. Salt fish markets, small temples, local seafood, traditional boat tours through the stilt house channels. ~2.5 hours</li>
                <li><strong>10:00 AM</strong> — 🦐 Local seafood breakfast or early lunch at a Tai O waterfront restaurant</li>
                <li><strong>12:00 PM</strong> — Bus 11 back to Tung Chung (~30 min)</li>
